{"title":" Doors Open Brampton Road Trip — Heritage, History & Hidden Gems! $20","startsAt":"2026-10-03T08:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-03T15:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"# Doors Open Brampton Road Trip — Heritage, History & Hidden Gems!\n\n**Saturday, October 3, 2026**\n\nReady to explore Brampton from a whole new perspective? Join us for a Saturday road trip to[ ](https://www.doorsopenontario.on.ca/pages/events/brampton)**[Doors Open Brampton](https://www.doorsopenontario.on.ca/pages/events/brampton)**[, ](https://www.doorsopenontario.on.ca/pages/events/brampton)where historic buildings, museums, heritage sites and other interesting spaces open their doors to the public.\n\n### 🚗 The Road Trip\n\nWe'll meet **outside Christie Station at 8:30 AM** and travel together in a **Kia Soul equipped with SiriusXM radio**. 🎶\nWe'll head to Brampton for a day of exploring, with a focus on the downtown area so we can walk between several locations.\n\n### 💵 COST: $20\n\nThere is a **$20 charge for this event**.\nYour $20 covers:\n\n* 🚗 Round-trip transportation from Toronto to Brampton\n* ⛽ Fuel\n* 🔧 Other car operating expenses\n\n**Doors Open Brampton itself is free** — the $20 is strictly to cover the cost of transportation and operating the vehicle.\n\n### ⚠️ VERY LIMITED SPOTS!\n\nThis is a **very limited-capacity road trip**, so if you're interested, **sign up quickly!**\nTo lock in your spot, please send a **$20 e-transfer to:**\nnicolasbello@yahoo.com\n\n**Your spot is not confirmed until the $20 e-transfer has been received.**\n\n### 🏛️ [Exploring Brampton](https://www.doorsopenontario.on.ca/pages/events/brampton)\n\nWe'll focus on the downtown area and visit as many interesting Doors Open locations as we can within our limited time.\nPossible stops include:\n**📍 Brampton Downtown Heritage Walk**\nExplore Brampton's history, architecture and stories from the city's past.\n**📍 Alderlea**\nA beautifully preserved **1867 Italianate villa** overlooking Gage Park.\n**📍 Peel Art Gallery, Museum & Archives (PAMA)**\nExplore exhibitions, museum spaces and special Doors Open programming.\n**📍 Brampton Library – Four Corners Branch**\nCheck out this downtown location and its local-history resources.\nWe'll add other participating Doors Open locations as time permits.\n\n### ⏰ IMPORTANT TIMING\n\n**8:30 AM** — Meet outside Christie Station\n**8:30 AM** — Depart Toronto\n**10:00 AM** — Doors Open Brampton begins\n**10:00 AM–3:00 PM** — Explore Brampton\n**3:00 PM SHARP** — Depart Brampton for Toronto\n\n⚠️ **The 3 PM departure is firm!**\nNick has a **Nuit Blanche volunteer shift in Toronto**, so we absolutely need to leave Brampton at **3:00 PM sharp**.\nThat gives us roughly five hours to explore, so we'll keep things moving and make the most of our time.\n\n### 🎶 THE RIDE\n\nTravel in a **Kia Soul with SiriusXM radio**, good conversation and hopefully some great fall weather.\nThe ride there and back is part of the fun!\n\n### 👟 WHAT TO BRING\n\n* Comfortable walking shoes\n* Weather-appropriate clothing\n* Water\n* Camera/phone\n* Money for lunch, coffee or snacks\n* Your curiosity!\n\n**Rain or shine — we're going!**\n\n### 📌 MEETING POINT\n\n**Outside Christie Station**\n**8:30 AM SHARP**\nPlease arrive a few minutes early so we can leave on time.\n\n### 💰 RESERVE YOUR SPOT\n\n**$20 per person**\n📧 Send your **$20 e-transfer to** nicolasbello@yahoo.com to lock in your spot.\n🚨 **VERY LIMITED SPOTS AVAILABLE — SIGN UP FAST IF YOU'RE INTERESTED!**\n\nCome explore Brampton's history, architecture and hidden gems with us! 🏛️🚗","venue":{"name":"Christie Station Labyrinth","address":"Christie, 5 Christie St, Toronto, ON M6G 3B1, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.66399,"lng":-79.418724,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/3/c/b/d/highres_536355549.jpeg"}